station-event-sector-darkness-start-announcement = Attention! Long-range sensors detect an anomalous distortion of space. The light of the stars is fading and the sector is sinking into darkness. Radio contact is lost on all frequencies, lighting and airlock failures are possible. Crews are advised to stay alert and not leave their vessels unless necessary.
station-event-sector-darkness-end-announcement = The anomalous distortion of space has dissipated. The darkness has receded and starlight reaches the sector again. Radio contact is restored.

station-event-sector-brightness-start-announcement = Attention! Long-range sensors have registered a bright flash and an anomalous brightening of space. The sector is flooded with diffuse light, space can be seen without extra lighting.
station-event-sector-brightness-end-announcement = The anomalous glow of space has faded. The sector returns to its usual darkness.

station-event-sector-darkness-message-1 = You don't feel safe.
station-event-sector-darkness-message-2 = You feel afraid.
station-event-sector-darkness-message-3 = It feels like someone is watching you.
station-event-sector-darkness-message-4 = A chill runs down your spine.
station-event-sector-darkness-message-5 = The darkness thickens around you.
station-event-sector-darkness-message-6 = You hear a whisper somewhere at the edge of your mind.
station-event-sector-darkness-message-7 = You are filled with a deep unease.
station-event-sector-darkness-message-8 = You want to be somewhere far away from here.

station-event-sector-brightness-message-1 = You feel fulfilled.
station-event-sector-brightness-message-2 = An inexplicable calm fills you.
station-event-sector-brightness-message-3 = You feel a pleasant warmth.
station-event-sector-brightness-message-4 = Your heart grows lighter.
station-event-sector-brightness-message-5 = It feels like everything will be fine.
station-event-sector-brightness-message-6 = You feel a surge of strength.
station-event-sector-brightness-message-7 = The light seems to pass right through you.
station-event-sector-brightness-message-8 = You feel a strange peace.
